        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "洞窟の中にかわいらしいくしゃみの音が響く。\n見れば、メリッサさんは不思議そうな顔をして\n自分の体をさすっていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "bbaaa1beead36ef2af3fdf89edf6ef8f9c336b1992f0c0e3547622abafc49f9f",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ふむ……なんだか体が冷たいぞ。\nそなた、妾に何が起きているか知っているか？\n何かの魔法か、それとも毒の類であろうか？",
      "jp_sha256": "001ae885258c6ae65fa17e06a094dca6f3f56d6b18a27ed9c48c75ce72e41aa0",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "흠……왠지 몸이 차갑구나.\n그대, 짐에게 무슨 일이 생겼는지 아느냐?\n무슨 마법인가, 아니면 독 같은 것인가?",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 34,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b002-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
